WEBVTT

00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:01.819
"If you want to compete and win
in the global economy,

00:03:01.843 --> 00:03:03.311
go to college."

00:03:03.776 --> 00:03:06.750
"What you earn depends on what you learn."

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:09.125
"You can make it if you try."

00:03:10.327 --> 00:03:16.216
These elites miss the insult
implicit in this advice.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.125
If you don't go to college,

00:03:19.149 --> 00:03:22.645
if you don't flourish in the new economy,

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:25.292
your failure is your fault.

00:03:25.819 --> 00:03:27.493
That's the implication.

00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:33.500
It's no wonder many working people
turned against meritocratic elites.